      en: ["Established as a national park in 1997", "Highest peak is Mount Djebobo", "Total area of approx. 360 km²", "Part of the Togo-Atakora mountain range", "Borders Fazao-Malfakassa Park in Togo", "Home to over 230 species of birds"],
