      en: ["The reserve encompasses a total area of approximately 51 square kilometers.", "It was formally established as a protected resource reserve in 1962.", "The inselbergs are primarily composed of ancient Precambrian granite-gneiss.", "The Shai people were evicted in 1892 following a British military expedition.", "The park hosts a significant and well-studied colony of olive baboons.", "The Manya Krobo cave was historically used for ancestral coronation rites."],
